{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "limit of floor(x)/x as x -> inf:\n  inf/inf: a step function at infinity: use u + O(1): lim 1\n  = 1\n  numeric (x = 10*2^k, k = 0..21): 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit floor(x)/x as x -> (inf)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "inf", "side": "both", "limit": {"kind": "number", "value": 1, "text": "1"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric_left", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}], "files": [], "text": "limit of floor(x)/x as x -> inf:\n  inf/inf: a step function at infinity: use u + O(1): lim 1\n  = 1\n  numeric (x = 10*2^k, k = 0..21): 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "limit of (x - floor(x))/x as x -> inf:\n  inf - inf: x - floor(x) = (1/(floor(x)) - 1/(x))/(1/((x)*(floor(x))))\n  0/0: a step function at infinity: use u + O(1): lim 0\n  = 0\n  numeric (x = 10*2^k, k = 0..21): 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 0 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit (x - floor(x))/x as x -> (inf)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "inf", "side": "both", "limit": {"kind": "number", "value": 0, "text": "0"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric_left", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}], "files": [], "text": "limit of (x - floor(x))/x as x -> inf:\n  inf - inf: x - floor(x) = (1/(floor(x)) - 1/(x))/(1/((x)*(floor(x))))\n  0/0: a step function at infinity: use u + O(1): lim 0\n  = 0\n  numeric (x = 10*2^k, k = 0..21): 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 0 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Maclaurin (Taylor at 0) series of 1/(x^2 + 1) at x = 0, through order 8:\n  1/(x^2 + 1) = 1 - x^2 + x^4 - x^6 + x^8 + O(x^9)\n  as x -> 0; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(0)/k!: 1 0 -1 0 1 0 -1 0 1\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 9.9e-11 at x = 0 ± 1/10, 9.74e-14 at ± 1/20, 9.54e-17 at ± 1/40 (at rounding level)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "taylor", "ucas": "taylor 1/(1+x^2) x at 0 order 8", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "taylor", "var": "x", "at": 0, "order": 8, "polynomial": "1 - x^2 + x^4 - x^6 + x^8", "coefficients": ["1", "0", "-1", "0", "1", "0", "-1", "0", "1"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "taylor_jet", "points": 9, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "coefficients against long double Taylor-jet arithmetic"}], "files": [], "text": "Maclaurin (Taylor at 0) series of 1/(x^2 + 1) at x = 0, through order 8:\n  1/(x^2 + 1) = 1 - x^2 + x^4 - x^6 + x^8 + O(x^9)\n  as x -> 0; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(0)/k!: 1 0 -1 0 1 0 -1 0 1\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 9.9e-11 at x = 0 ± 1/10, 9.74e-14 at ± 1/20, 9.54e-17 at ± 1/40 (at rounding level)\n"}, "isError": false}}
